{
    "title": "Texas Hunt & Fish",
    "description": "Built specifically for Texas, this official app helps hunters and anglers report harvest, access many public hunting areas, and view license holdings from your phone or tablet while helping Texas Parks and Wildlife Department manage healthy game and fish populations. \r\n\r\nWith Texas Hunt & Fish, you can:\r\n\r\n-\tConnect and display your hunting and fishing license (paper license holders must still carry physical tags when pursuing tagged species)\r\n\r\n-\tPerform mandatory hunt harvest reporting for wild turkey, white-tailed deer, and alligator gar\r\n\r\n-\tDigitally tag harvested game and fish (requires purchase of an appropriate digital hunting and/or fishing license)\r\n\r\n-\tReport and track harvest of many other native game animals as well as flounder and red snapper catches\r\n\r\n-\tPerform electronic onsite registration (eOSR) for many public hunt areas\r\n\r\n-\tDownload maps of many public hunt areas for use with or without data service\r\n\r\n-\tView CWD Zone boundaries and, if location service are enabled, determine your position in relation to the nearest zone\r\n\r\n-\tReportar su cosecha en espa\u00f1ol o en ingl\u00e9s - report your harvest in English or Spanish\r\n\r\n-\tNote: tagging requirements associated with your license type still apply when using this app. If your license comes with physical tags and a harvest log on the license, all physical documentation must be completed, regardless of use of this app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Built specifically for Texas, this official app helps hunters and anglers report harvest, access many public hunting areas, and view license holdings from your phone or tablet while helping Texas Parks and Wildlife Department manage healthy game and fish populations. <br><br>With Texas Hunt &amp; Fish, you can:<br><br>-\tConnect and display your hunting and fishing license (paper license holders must still carry physical tags when pursuing tagged species)<br><br>-\tPerform mandatory hunt harvest reporting for wild turkey, white-tailed deer, and alligator gar<br><br>-\tDigitally tag harvested game and fish (requires purchase of an appropriate digital hunting and/or fishing license)<br><br>-\tReport and track harvest of many other native game animals as well as flounder and red snapper catches<br><br>-\tPerform electronic onsite registration (eOSR) for many public hunt areas<br><br>-\tDownload maps of many public hunt areas for use with or without data service<br><br>-\tView CWD Zone boundaries and, if location service are enabled, determine your position in relation to the nearest zone<br><br>-\tReportar su cosecha en espa\u00f1ol o en ingl\u00e9s - report your harvest in English or Spanish<br><br>-\tNote: tagging requirements associated with your license type still apply when using this app. If your license comes with physical tags and a harvest log on the license, all physical documentation must be completed, regardless of use of this app.",
